# Landlord team member is optional

Name, phone, and email for a **team member** (stored as `backupContact*`) are optional.

## Do

- Allow finishing setup, Fast Track import, and Organization Settings save with all team member fields blank
- Sync portal login / ops SMS only when email or phone is present
- Keep “(optional)” in landlord-facing labels

## Do not

- Block onboarding complete or continue-import on missing team member
- Auto-send welcome SMS or email when a team member is added
- Treat team member email as required for account access
